serve the same behavior with\r\nscheduler which fire every 15 minutes\r\n\r\nBest regards\r\n\r\nLe lun. 7 juin 2021 à 11:30, Guillaume Smet ***@***.***> a\r\nécrit :\r\n\r\n> Are you sure it's not just the event being slightly delayed and you have 2\r\n> events in the same second because the one before was a bit delayed?\r\n>\r\n> That being said, a one second delay looks like a lot.\r\n>\r\n> —\r\n> You are receiving this because you authored the thread.\r\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\r\n> <https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/17724#issuecomment-855769866>,\r\n> or unsubscribe\r\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/ABVC36RVFSCJ3E3LA5RR6A3TRSGTFANCNFSM46HG43UQ>\r\n> .\r\n>\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/855787402/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jmpdev34","id":6958586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTg1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6958586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34","html_url":"https://github.com/jmpdev34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmpdev34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/856009180","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/17724#issuecomment-856009180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/17724","id":856009180,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1NjAwOTE4MA==","user":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-07T14:57:49Z","updated_at":"2021-06-07T14:58:44Z","body":"Well, I was able to reproduce the `Already triggered ...` behavior, by slowing down my machine significantly. But it's not that the triggers would be fired at once. If you modify [this line](https://github.com/jmpdev34/reproducer-scheduler-native/blob/master/src/main/java/org/acme/ReproducerScheduler.java#L27) to something like `System.out.println(\"Triggered at : \" + now + \" but already triggered : \" + maps.get(time));` you'll see that the second trigger is fired > 900ms after the first one:\r\n```\r\nTriggered at : 2021-06-07T16:40:11.004974\r\nTriggered at : 2021-06-07T16:40:11.999259 but already triggered : 2021-06-07T16:40:11.004974 executor-thread-1 4\r\n```\r\nThat's far from being ideal of course but at least it's fired \"roughly every second\".\r\n\r\nWe will need to analyze the scheduling logic and find out if we can do better...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/856009180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/856033462","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/17724#issuecomment-856033462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/17724","id":856033462,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1NjAzMzQ2Mg==","user":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_